@q_sample_import:Q{ck=~165:The destination engine displays the sprite at the intended sampling and scale, with the intended pivot and transparency, with no resampling artifacts or atlas bleed.;dm=engine;md=live;nm=~13:engine import;so=[@brief];wh=@user}
@q_sample_readable:Q{ck=~194:At the intended display scale the scout reads as a side-view character: head, torso, leading leg and its role-identifying gear separate from each other and from light, dark and busy backgrounds.;dm=visual;md=visual;nm=~15:sample readable;so=[@brief,@kmethods];wh=@user}
